| 🔴 Critical | 0 | — |
| 🟡 Moderate | 4 | Chained regex + substring allocations in hot-path methods |
| ℹ️ Info | 3 | Culture-unsafe ToLower, unsealed class, duplicate regex |

**Priority order for your hot path:** Fix #1 (Underscore) → #2 (Pascalize) → #3 (Camelize) → #4 (InflectionRule startup). The first three together could reduce allocations by 5-8× per call in the pipeline.

